What:		/sys/devices/platform/soc/<addr>.video-codec/busy_ns
Date:		November 2026
Contact:	linux-media@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		Read-only cumulative nanoseconds during which at least one frame
		was in flight on this Apple AVE encoder instance. Concurrent
		frames or sessions are merged as a union so the counter never
		grows faster than wall-clock time. When a read occurs while
		frames are in flight, the elapsed time of the active interval
		is included. Mode 0444 (readable by non-root users).

What:		/sys/devices/platform/soc/<addr>.video-codec/active_sessions
Date:		November 2026
Contact:	linux-media@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		Read-only count of currently open encoding sessions attached to
		the firmware on this Apple AVE encoder instance. Mode 0444.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/soc/<addr>.video-codec/frames
Date:		November 2026
Contact:	linux-media@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		Read-only cumulative count of completed encoded frames returned
		by the firmware on this Apple AVE encoder instance. Mode 0444.
